  "headline": "Investigation Expands Into Illegal Wiretapping Of President Prabowo",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Wiretapping Case Investigation Updates",
  "metaDescription": "Authorities prepare for a case hearing as investigations into the illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto expand to identify new suspects.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Coordinating Minister Yusril Ihza Mahendra confirmed that additional suspects may be named in the ongoing illegal wiretapping investigation.",
    "A formal case hearing is scheduled for November 19, 2026, at the Attorney General's Office to review developments.",
    "Security measures have been intensified within the President's inner circle to ensure the integrity of official communications."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government is actively investigating a breach involving the illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. As the inquiry continues, officials, including the Coordinating Minister for Law, Human Rights, Immigration, and Corrections, have indicated the possibility of identifying further suspects and potentially introducing additional criminal charges. A high-level case hearing is set for November 19, 2026, to address the findings of investigators. Current measures include the placement of high-ranking police officials in special confinement while their involvement is reviewed. Additionally, the State Secretariat has implemented stricter security protocols to sanitize the President's immediate environment against further intelligence risks. The police are also examining potential external parties linked to the unauthorized surveillance, while the force manages internal disciplinary actions, including dismissals, for personnel found in violation of conduct codes.",
